findings.description:
BaseItemExporter pops 'indent' with a default of None, but the docs (exporters.rst) say the default is indent=0. Anyone using JsonItemExporter directly without an indent now gets `[{...},{...}]` on a single line instead of the old `[
{...},
{...}
]`. That silently changes existing output. Only feed exports keep the old format, because FEED_EXPORT_INDENT defaults to 0. The default should be 0 to match the docs and keep backward compatibility.
